### resonate — pipeline artifacts ###

# Regenerable per-song outputs. Keep song.md and plan.json; ignore the rest.
songs/**/score.abc
songs/**/score.mid
songs/**/song.wav
songs/**/.score.loud.mid

# Stray intermediates anywhere else
